{
  "kit": "Suite Demo Kit",
  "version": "1.0",
  "collection": "Suite Demo Kit",
  "about": "The single source of truth for the kit's names, kinds and fixed UUIDs (plan section 5). The Stream Deck profiles bind to these: scenes by __scene_index_N__ (their position here), Playlister keys by source uuid, filter keys by source uuid + filter name + filter kind (versioned_id), layer keys by scene name + item id. uuid = sha256('suite-demo-kit:' + seed)[:16] with the RFC 4122 version 4 and variant bits; the seed is the name, or '<source>/<filter>' for a filter. demo-kit/kit_collection.py checks this file against that rule.",
